-- =====================================================================
-- The 24 courses of the franchise proposal, in the ERP and on the website.
--
-- Each course with its modules (as the proposal lists them), a chapter
-- list under every module, one exam subject per module (theory 100 / pass
-- 33; practical, assignment and project modules as practical 100 / 33),
-- and offered at every live branch.
--
-- DCA and ADCA already existed as "DCA With AI" (3 months) and "ADCA With
-- AI" (6 months). They are brought in line with the proposal -- name,
-- duration, description and modules -- keeping their fee and photo; their
-- old modules are retired (deletedAt set), not deleted. DCA's own static
-- page gives way to the course page, which shows the new syllabus.
--
-- No fee is set on a new course: the website shows "Ask the centre" until
-- the office enters one under Courses -> All Courses.
--
-- Safe to re-run: courses are matched by code, modules by name, and a
-- course that already has exam subjects gets no more.
-- =====================================================================

do $seed$
